# The PostgREST read API. It serves the `api` schema on the loopback address only.
#
# Leave it empty and the application reads from `http://127.0.0.1:3000`, which is the address the
# local compose file publishes. That fallback is the second half of what makes the application run
# with no configuration at all. Set it to the address of another read service, and the application
# reads from that instead. A value that is set but malformed stops the read.
VITE_API_URL=
